   - :func:`jax.numpy.linalg.cholesky`: NumPy-stype Cholesky API
   - :func:`jax.lax.linalg.cholesky`: XLA-style Cholesky API
   - :func:`jax.scipy.linalg.cho_factor`
   - :func:`jax.scipy.linalg.cho_solve`

